
<view class="about-container">
  <view class="header">
    <text class="title">About Page</text>
  </view>

  <view class="content-box">
    <text class="description">
      This is a simple, lightweight tool for monitoring the uptime and downtime of our services. 
      We will also have a compilation of the services set for a specific time period ie daily, weekly and monthly.
      This will help with the logs and alerts and more such as : 
    </text>

    <view class="features">
      <view class="feature-item">
          <ant-icon type="CloseCircleFill" 
        size="24" color="#52c41a" />
        <text>Monitor individual microservice availability</text>
      </view>
      <view class="feature-item">
        <ant-icon type="ArrowsAltOutline" size="24" color="#faad14" />
        <text>View combined system-wide uptime metrics</text>
      </view>
      <view class="feature-item">
        <ant-icon type="CheckOutline" size="24" color="#1890ff" />
        <text>Generate custom daily or weekly reports</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="uptime-box">

      <view class="feature-item">
        <ant-icon type='ChatCheckOutline' />
          <text>Uptime today: {{uptimeToday}}%</text>
     </view>

      <view class="feature-item">
        <ant-icon type='ChatCheckOutline' />
          <text>Uptime this week: {{uptimeWeek}}%</text>
      </view>
     
    </view>
    <view class="about-btn">
      <ant-button type="primary" block onTap="viewHistory">View History</ant-button>

    </view>

  </view>
</view>

